  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Sri Krishna Kummara\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Sri Krishna Kummara</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 27, 2026 at 02:19 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/vijayawada\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vijayawada</a>:Vice-President <a href=\"/tag/cp+radhakrishnan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CP Radhakrishnan</a> on Monday urged <a href=\"/tag/dr+ntr+university+of+health+sciences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr NTR University of Health Sciences</a> (NTRUHS) to forge partnerships with leading research institutions worldwide to strengthen medical research and provide students with greater exposure to global scientific opportunities.Addressing the university’s <a href=\"/tag/ruby+jubilee+celebrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ruby Jubilee celebrations</a> in Vijayawada as the chief guest, Radhakrishnan said international collaborations would enable medical students to access advanced research facilities, exchange scientific knowledge and contribute to solutions for critical health challenges.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Emphasising the need to promote a strong research culture among medical students and healthcare professionals, he expressed hope that someone from NTRUHS would one day win a Nobel Prize by finding a cure or breakthrough treatment for deadly diseases such as cancer.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Highlighting the growth of medical education in the country, the Vice-President said that under the leadership of Prime Minister <a href=\"/tag/narendra+modi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Narendra Modi</a>, the number of medical colleges had increased from 387 before 2014 to 846 in 2026. He said MBBS seats had risen by 172%, from about 51,000 to 1.40 lakh, while postgraduate medical seats had reached nearly 86,000.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Radhakrishnan also underlined the growing role of <a href=\"/tag/artificial+intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">artificial intelligence</a> and <a href=\"/tag/telemedicine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">telemedicine</a> in healthcare. While technology could improve diagnosis, treatment and access to medical services, doctors should not lose sight of the human touch in patient care, he said, adding that scientific advancement must go hand in hand with compassion and empathy.</p><p>Recalling the contributions of former chief minister and actor <a href=\"/tag/n+t+rama+rao\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">N T Rama Rao</a>, who founded NTRUHS in 1986, the Vice-President said his legacy extended beyond cinema to public life and social development. He also credited NTR with helping address Chennai’s drinking water needs.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Calling for collective action against substance abuse, Radhakrishnan urged doctors and healthcare professionals to play a proactive role in creating awareness about the dangers of drug abuse and in building a drug-free society.Governor S Abdul Nazeer, National Medical Commission Undergraduate Medical Education Board member Dr M K Ramesh, I&amp;PR Minister K Parthasarathy, Vijayawada MP Kesineni Sivanath, NTRUHS vice-chancellor Dr P Chandrasekhar and others attended the event.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Sri Krishna Kummara</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Sri Krishna Kummara</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 27, 2026 at 02:19 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 27, 2026 at 02:19 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">2 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme